# Supabase connection (client-side, browser-safe).
#
# These are OPTIONAL. The app ships with a shared public Supabase project baked
# in as defaults (see src/lib/supabase.ts), so you can clone, `npm install`, and
# `npm run dev` with no setup. Copy this file to `.env` only if you want to point
# the app at your OWN Supabase project.
#
# The anon/publishable key is meant to be public and is protected by row-level
# security. NEVER put your service_role key in this file or any client env.

